Title: Neon Courier - Episode 1 "The Drop"

EXT. ROOFTOP GARDEN - NIGHT

Rain over a neon skyline. MIRA (20s, black leather courier jacket) waits by her motorbike.

JUNO (her younger sister, silver locket) steps out of the shadows and presses a datachip into Mira's palm.

JUNO
It's the Voss ledger. Every bribe he ever paid.

MIRA
Then it's worth more than both of us.

Juno taps her locket.

JUNO
If anything happens, the locket opens the vault.

INT. NIGHT MARKET - CONTINUOUS

Mira weaves through noodle stalls. KAI (hacker, cracked AR visor) falls into step beside her.

KAI
Heard you're carrying something heavy tonight.

MIRA
Heard wrong.

INT. VOSS TOWER - PENTHOUSE - LATER

DIRECTOR VOSS (60s, white suit) watches the market on a wall of screens. Kai's face appears on a call.

KAI (V.O.)
She has the chip. I'll stay close.

VOSS
Good. Nobody knows you're mine, Kai. Keep it that way.

EXT. ROOFTOP GARDEN - LATER

Juno's locket lies in a puddle. Juno is gone. Mira's bike headlight sweeps the empty roof.

MIRA
Juno?

SMASH TO BLACK.
